claudeos-desktop
================

This meta package pulls in every ClaudeOS component:

  claudeos-core              OS prompt, Claude Code managed settings, first boot, doctor
  claudeos-side-panel        the docked Claude panel and the claudeos-panel launcher
  claudeos-computer-control  the claudeos-desktop MCP server (screen, input, windows, files)
  claudeos-nautilus          the "Ask Claude" Nautilus action
  claudeos-calamares         installer configuration and branding
  claudeos-theme             wallpapers, GTK theme and GNOME defaults

ClaudeOS never uses API keys: sign in with your Claude Pro or Max subscription
(claude auth login --claudeai, or the panel's onboarding wizard).

Source and documentation: see the ClaudeOS repository (README.md, docs/).
